guard_bash.py notice

Parts of guard_bash.py port logic from cc-safety-net
(https://github.com/kenryu42/cc-safety-net, commit e9aff6a,
e9aff6a62e30b9c3ee7a14bc7ae69b5dfff1aa42): the shell-wrapper unwrapping and
recursion limit, fail-closed rules, secret-path rules and exceptions, git
global-option stripping and git/rm/find rules. The logic was rewritten in
Python; it is used under the MIT licence below.

